    "title": "Gusts 70-100 mph forecast for Central Montana - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Rattner NonStop Local Digital Journalist ,\n3 hours ago MONTANA — Central Montana is experiencing gusty winds this evening, with areas such as Great Falls and Helena seeing winds gusting up to 70 mph. The Rocky Mountain Front could experience gusts reaching 100 mph. High Wind Warnings and Advisories are expected to remain in effect through Friday morning. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
